+### Convert to Seconds
+
+Use `toSeconds` to get the whole number of seconds, rounded down, from a duration string or a number of milliseconds.
+
+```ts
+import { toSeconds } from 'ms';
+
+toSeconds('90s'); // 90
+toSeconds('2m'); // 120
+toSeconds(1500); // 1
+```
+
 ### Enhanced Type Safety
 
 If you want strict type checking for the input value, you can use `parseStrict`.
